{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_comment": "Workshop sandbox defaults — broad allowlist suitable for a 2-day prototype. The Kickoff Interview tailors this to the locked stack (prunes pkg managers, etc.). Tighten before reusing for anything production-shaped.",
